---
description: Shared team rules for all AI agents (same as AGENTS.md)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root before doing anything. It is the
single source of truth for all agents (Cursor, Claude Code, Codex).

Short version:
1. Start: run `bash scripts/context-brief.sh` (STATE, CONTRACTS, open questions,
   decisions, 10 newest logs). Reply to your human with a 5-line summary first.
2. While working: write chat decisions into DECISIONS.md / OPEN_QUESTIONS.md at
   once; checkpoint a log entry at least every 30-45 minutes.
3. Finish or hand off: run scripts/new-log.sh "title" (or new-log.ps1), fill every
   field with an exact "Next step", update CONTRACTS.md / DECISIONS.md if needed,
   update only your own section of STATE.md, commit code and context together.
4. Never touch files the other person owns or has in progress without asking.
5. No secrets in git. No mocked data in the Bright Data path. Never say a
   route is "safe".
